      <p class="saas-intro">The first 90 days produced 11 qualified product demonstrations. Four buyers moved into meaningful sales opportunities. Continued follow up and product evaluation contributed to two customers signing for the platform within six months. The remaining conversations were treated according to fit and timing rather than forced into an artificial close.</p>
